this is a beautiful viewing of essentially the same code for FK and IK
but written completely in HTML. Just open chrome (Ctrl 0) and open this index.html

set the animation timing using the slider at the bottom. Can watch the entire simulation
or can do a step by step simulation.

This is a 3D grid view, with an actual red ball and the 4 link robot arm fully working
with FK and IK ! 

(invokes https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js for rendering etc)

